			"Message": "docs: Standardize branding to \"VS Code\" and improve clone instructions\n\nThis commit makes two key improvements to the Land project documentation:\n\n1. **Branding Consistency**: Updates all references from \"VSCode\" to \"VS Code\" (with proper spacing) across multiple configuration files:\n   - `.gitignore`: Updated comment for build output directory\n   - `.lychee.toml`: Updated exclude comment for internal links\n   - `prettier.config.js`: Updated comment in JSON configuration section\n   - `README.md`: Added 👨🏻‍🏭 emoji to the Common component description\n\n2. **Enhanced Clone Instructions**: Significantly expands and clarifies the repository cloning steps in README.md. The previous single command has been replaced with a detailed 6-step process that explicitly guides users through initializing each layer of submodules (Element, Dependency, Microsoft, and Editor).\n\nAdditionally, the `Maintain/Profile.sh` script has been normalized (whitespace/formatting cleanup) while preserving all existing functionality.\n\nThese changes improve clarity for new contributors and ensure consistent branding across the project.",
			"SHA": "58261e96f071fe4d52ce2dd6f8c9f8aaed131b34"
		},
